{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.poster.avif?t=1754901194\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.webm?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.mp4?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Break into a college. Woo some girls. Avoid the principal. Don\u2019t get caught. Easy, right?</strong><br>Welcome to <strong>School Crisis</strong> \u2014 a chaotic, anime-inspired co-op adventure for up to 4 players. You and your not-so-innocent friends are sneaking into an all-girls college, each with your own questionable motivations. Whether you're trying to impress a crush, prove a point, or just be a nerd on a mission, your goal is simple: <strong>complete missions, avoid guards, and escape with your dignity intact</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/61b03d20b317e0cdb2dc12a5aaf6da64.poster.avif?t=1754901194\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/61b03d20b317e0cdb2dc12a5aaf6da64.webm?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/61b03d20b317e0cdb2dc12a5aaf6da64.mp4?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>4 Unique Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with their own backstory and flavor. Choose wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Objective-Based Missions</strong> \u2013 Talk to the girls, collect what they want, and bring it back\u2026 preferably without getting tackled by a security guard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>AI Guards That Hunt You</strong> \u2013 Two beefy patrols and one terrifying principal with super speed. Stealth is your best friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Loot &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Grab shiny items while exploring and sell them in the city for upgrades. Hustle culture, but make it anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Comedy Meets Chaos</strong> \u2013 Think <i>Lethal Company</i> meets <i>Devour</i>, with a ridiculous anime twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer Co-Op (1-4 Players)</strong> \u2013 Team up or goof off with your friends. Just remember: if one of you gets caught\u2026 it\u2019s game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.poster.avif?t=1754901194\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.webm?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.mp4?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School Crisis isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a test of stealth, friendship, and who\u2019s got the guts to flirt their way through danger. Are you ready to cause chaos in the most prestigious girls\u2019 college of the year?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.poster.avif?t=1754901194\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.webm?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.mp4?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777300?t=1754901194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/4efe5d5b62687509ad75de281fe9715728574ac5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754901194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/696e12dc432b0cafb85033e68273f056f8dab951/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754901194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/696e12dc432b0cafb85033e68273f056f8dab951/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754901194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some female characters wear swimsuits or revealing clothing. No sexual content or explicit scenes.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.poster.avif?t=17549011