ting tackled by a security guard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>AI Guards That Hunt You</strong> \u2013 Two beefy patrols and one terrifying principal with super speed. Stealth is your best friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Loot &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Grab shiny items while exploring and sell them in the city for upgrades. Hustle culture, but make it anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Comedy Meets Chaos</strong> \u2013 Think <i>Lethal Company</i> meets <i>Devour</i>, with a ridiculous anime twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer Co-Op (1-4 Players)</strong> \u2013 Team up or goof off with your friends. Just remember: if one of you gets caught\u2026 it\u2019s game over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.poster.avif?t=1754901194\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.webm?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.mp4?t=1754901194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School Crisis isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a test of stealth, friendship, and who\u2019s got the guts to flirt their way through danger. Are you ready to cause chaos in the most prestigious girls\u2019 college of the year?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.