c/ss_20e55120c2bdbffb18e6be84aee2002dd5888f6c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754901194","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/20e55120c2bdbffb18e6be84aee2002dd5888f6c/ss_20e55120c2bdbffb18e6be84aee2002dd5888f6c.600x338.jpg?t=1754901194"}],"short_description":"A third-person co-op stealth game where you and up to 3 friends sneak into an all-girls college, complete hilarious missions, avoid guards, and try not to get caught. Anime chaos meets multiplayer comedy.","steam_appid":3777300,"support_info":{"email":"masskai.th@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}